# infra/apparatus/queries/p99-during-vs-outside-olap.cwli
#
# Inputs:  /dda/api log group; ADOT OTLP traces forwarded to CloudWatch
# Outputs: p99 latency series binned at 30s, scoped to /orders/ requests
# Contract field: #7 (Observed Result) — OLTP p99 in/out OLAP window
#
# Pair with a manual annotation marking the OLAP windows at T+5m, T+10m,
# T+15m from the k6 start timestamp. Module 03 / 04 / 05 each annotate
# their own run.

fields @timestamp, @message
| filter ispresent(http.method) and http.target like /\/orders\//
| stats pct(latency_ms, 99) as p99 by bin(30s)
